post.description:
POST /api/auth/login
Body: { "email": "...", "password": "...", "token_name": "optional name" }

Returns: Bearer token to be used in Authorization header for subsequent requests.

Expected payload format from Fingerspot:
{
  "trans_id": "123456",
  "cloud_id": "C001",
  "attlog": [
    {
      "pin": "123",
      "datetime": "2026-02-03 08:00:00",
      "status_scan": "0",
      "verify_mode": "1"
    }
  ]
}

Or single attlog:
{
  "pin": "123",
  "datetime": "2026-02-03 08:00:00",
  "status_scan": "0",
  "verify_mode": "1",
  "sn": "DEVICE001"
}
